	<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1" >knows that Warriors are superior</font><br>
	<img src="images/avatars/0/stewie1.gif" border="0" alt=""><p>
&nbsp;<br>
<a href="showthread.php?postid=6026#post6026"><font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1" >Post #2</font></a><br>
	<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1" >Registered: Apr 2003<br>
