	<td bgcolor="#000000" width="100%" valign="top">
	<font face="verdana,arial,helvetica" size="1" > <b></b></font>
	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2" >got no info on the map location as i am too lazy to check it out...but.<br />
<br />
you kill the giants in the room with the big throne (4 guards, three up on dais = 7 total)<br />
<br />
then when you are ready, get up on the throne and say "the dain must be slain for the peace we must obtain"<br />
<br />
Doldigun Steinweilder(dorf) spawns.  hit him and he despawns and 2 waves of 2 giants spawn, once the second pair has died, three more giants spawn one after another.<br />
<br />
After the giants are dead, doldigun spawns again and runs...kill him and loot his head.  for the head to be useful to you you have to be the one who said the phrase to start the cycle.<br />
<br />
mob level?  the pairs are prolly level 52 or so, the three singles are all red to me at 53 and get tougher as they go.  only the last one enrages, offtanking it while my 2 grps killed the previous one with about 1120AC he was hitting for 100-200ish, not overly fast, was pretty easy once he was slowed.<br />
<br />
You could do the cycle with one group say a 58+ tank, a cleric and a slower plud dps.  no crowd control other than an offtank is needed, and i can do it easily at 53 with 4k hps and 1100ac.<br />
<br />
We always try to bring a second group for dps cause they do have a shitload of hps, specially the last dude.  Offtanking him solo I can get him to 98% then he regens to 100% :P<br />
<br />
Plate pieces drop off of any of the giants in the cycle. Just to be safe you can wait got the 7 repops each time b4 you start the cycle again but if you are oober, just keep running the cycle over and over and deal with repops when they happen <img src="images/smilies/smile.gif" border="0" alt="">  I dont remember the respawn time though (<br />
<br />
hope some of that helps</font></p>
	
